    "body": "### Problem\n\nJust in markdown `dgj` and `dgk` behave like `dvj` and `dvk` respectively.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```sh\necho \"abc\\ndef\" | nvim --clean -\n```\n```vim\n:set ft=markdown\nfb\ndgj\n:w /tmp/tempfile\n```\n```console\n$ cat /tmp/tempfile\naef\n```\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n```console\n$ cat /tmp/tempfile\n\n```\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nv0.12.4\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nyes, vim 9.2\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nArch Linux\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nalacritty 0.17.0\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nalacritty\n\n### Installation\n\npacman",
