            "body": "> Working as intended\n\nCan you point me to the documentation section?\n\n> What does this have to with markdown? I get the same behavior regardless of filetype.\n\nOk, my setup was wrong. Do `:map j gj` then, `dj` will only behave like `dvj` in markdown.\n",
